message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "anderson-finite-core-lean"
abstract: "Lean 4 formalization of the finite-dimensional algebraic identities (absorption identities, common-phase closure, single-port energy identity, endpoint identity) of the openai/math preprint Pure-Point Spectrum for the Two-Dimensional Anderson Model at Every Positive Disorder. The paper's localization theorem is not formalized."
authors:
  - name: "Le Chen"
version: "0.1.0"
